# Read-only GETs, 2026-11-25, with gh api. Long answers cut to the fields shown.
$ gh api repos/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-sodium/pages
{"message":"Not Found","documentation_url":"https://docs.github.com/rest/pages/pages#get-a-apiname-pages-site","status":"404"}gh: Not Found (HTTP 404)

$ gh api repos/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-sodium/branches/main/protection
{"message":"Branch not protected","documentation_url":"https://docs.github.com/rest/branches/branch-protection#get-branch-protection","status":"404"}gh: Branch not protected (HTTP 404)

$ gh api repos/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-sodium/rulesets
[]
$ gh api repos/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-sodium/environments
{"total_count":0,"environments":[]}
$ gh api repos/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-sodium/tags
[]
$ gh api repos/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-sodium/releases
[]
$ gh api repos/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-sodium/rules/branches/main
[]
$ gh api repos/Kiyomi-Computation-Systems/chez-sodium --jq '{private, visibility, default_branch, has_pages, delete_branch_on_merge}'
{"default_branch":"main","delete_branch_on_merge":false,"has_pages":false,"private":false,"visibility":"public"}
